          hints: [String.raw`Same type as $\int\frac{x + 5}{x^2 + x - 2}\,\mathrm d x$: factor, template, multiply through, insert roots.`, String.raw`$x^2 - x - 6 = (x - 3)(x + 2)$ and $x + 7 = A(x + 2) + B(x - 3)$.`, String.raw`$x = 3$: $10 = 5A$. $x = -2$: $5 = -5B$.`],
