          hints: [String.raw`Same type as the guided $\int_1^2\frac{x^3 + x^2 + 2}{x^2 + x}\,\mathrm d x$: divide first.`, String.raw`$x^3 + 2x^2 + 3 = x(x^2 + 2x) + 3$, so the integrand is $x + \frac{3}{x(x + 2)}$.`, String.raw`$\frac{3}{x(x + 2)} = \frac{3/2}{x} - \frac{3/2}{x + 2}$.`],
